## Communication (A1b)

- Be direct and concise. Long answers: open with the verdict in one or two sentences.
- Bold sparingly; never bold whole sentences.
- Keep points to a sentence or two unless the user asks for depth. No tangents or redundant summaries.
- Ticket reports follow A5 in `core.mdc`; keep them short.
